-- #10 number-of-islands
UPDATE problems SET cheatsheet_md = '## Grid dimensions
```python
rows = len(grid)
cols = len(grid[0])
```

## Iterating grid
```python
for r in range(rows):
    for c in range(cols):
        # Access grid[r][c]
```

## DFS traversal
```python
def dfs(r, c):
    if r < 0 or r >= rows or c < 0 or c >= cols or grid[r][c] == ''0'':
        return
    grid[r][c] = ''0'' # Mark as visited
    dfs(r + 1, c)
    dfs(r - 1, c)
    dfs(r, c + 1)
    dfs(r, c - 1)
```

## BFS traversal
```python
from collections import deque
q = deque()
q.append((r, c))
grid[r][c] = ''0'' # Mark as visited
while q:
    curr_r, curr_c = q.popleft()
    for dr, dc in [(0, 1), (0, -1), (1, 0), (-1, 0)]:
        nr, nc = curr_r + dr, curr_c + dc
        if 0 <= nr < rows and 0 <= nc < cols and grid[nr][nc] == ''1'':
            grid[nr][nc] = ''0'' # Mark as visited
            q.append((nr, nc))
```' WHERE problem_id = 10;

