-- #37 combination-sum
UPDATE problems SET cheatsheet_md = '## Backtracking Function
```python
def backtrack(start_index, current_sum, current_combination):
    if current_sum == target:
        result.append(list(current_combination)) # Found a combination
        return
    if current_sum > target:
        return # Pruning: sum exceeds target

    for i in range(start_index, len(candidates)):
        num = candidates[i]
        current_combination.append(num)
        backtrack(i, current_sum + num, current_combination) # Recurse with current number
        current_combination.pop() # Backtrack
```

## List Initialization
```python
