dp[r][c] = grid[r][c] + min(dp[r-1][c], dp[r][c-1]) # From top or left
dp[r][c] = grid[r][c] + dp[r-1][c] # From top only
dp[r][c] = grid[r][c] + dp[r][c-1] # From left only
```

## Edge Cases (First Row/Column)
```python
if r > 0 and c == 0: # First column (not first row)
    dp[r][c] = grid[r][c] + dp[r-1][c]
if c > 0 and r == 0: # First row (not first column)
    dp[r][c] = grid[r][c] + dp[r][c-1]
```' WHERE problem_id = 40;

