## Star Quantifier (`*`)
```python
if len(p) >= 2 and p[1] == ''*'':
    # Case 1: ''*'' matches zero occurrences
    # Case 2: ''*'' matches one or more occurrences
    return self.isMatch(s, p[2:]) or \\
           (first_match and self.isMatch(s[1:], p))
```

## Standard Match
```python
return first_match and self.isMatch(s[1:], p[1:])
```

